# ANIMINFO Draft Rev 0.9.0

ANIMINFO is a cross-port (universal) animation substituation lump that allows authors to add alias animations and widescreen assets to graphic lumps. Examples of included lumps include M_DOOM, M_SKULL1, TITLEPIC, INTERPIC, STBAR, etc.

### Revision History

- Rev 0.9.0 (@andrikpowell, Jan 6 2026)
  - Initial draft implementation.
